im.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-22\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"A Nightmare on Nome Street\",\"overview\":\"Chris finds himself stranded on the ice. Shawn hits a mysterious dry spell. The Kellys' brand-new Crawler awakens but encounters electrical problems. A tangled tether spells bad news for Zeke and the boys. Vernon finds two divers are better than one.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-08-29\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Crawl to Redemption\",\"overview\":\"The Kellys unveil their secret gold mining weapon. Chris McCully's hot paystreak continues. A scary close call forces Zeke to adjust strategy. Jane butts heads with her crew as tensions boil over. Shawn discovers a hidden treasure at the bottom of the Bering Sea.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-05\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Wolf Of Wall Streak\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-12\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Jane's Affliction\",\"overview\":\"Jane clashes with Emily's crew over being disrespected. Equipment failures cause delays for Chris and Shawn. Kris is thrilled to find his Crawler in action. Pressure ridges cause one close call too many for Zeke and his crew.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-19\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Big Dig Energy\",\"overview\":\"The Kellys quarrel while trying to make their gold-sucking Crawler work. Some anatomical-looking worms in the sea may lead Shawn to gold. Vernon's best laid plans falter as he deals with health issues. Jane receives news of the birth of Emily's baby.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Last Duel\",\"overview\":\"Mr. Gold and Chris McCully battle it out for the top spot on the gold board. The Kellys are at risk of ending the season with no gold. After some dangerous dives, Jane, Vernon and Zeke's crews each make a push to finish the season with a bang.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":83}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-01-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}